    <div>
      <h3>Mine</h3>
      <p>This approach to starting citizen development: the sign-up as the first lesson, pages named for goals, one job per channel, and a loop instead of a course.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>Invented</h3>
      <p>Brindle Lake Public Library, its staff, schedule, sessions, page names and risks are invented to show the approach. None of it describes a real organization or program.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="wide">
      <h3>AI</h3>
      <p>AI helped me draft and check this page. I wrote the approach and graded the claims.</p>
